    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Doyle are delighted to present No. 23 The Elms. This most splendid 4 bed detached family home is ideally situated only minutes from all amenities to include schools, shops, public transport facilities and is just a short distance from the M7/N7 motorway.This superb family home is well presented and is in good decorative order throughout. The property boasts bright and spacious living accommodation which briefly comprises of; entrance hall, living room, family room, kitchen, living/dining room, utility room, guest w.c., 4 bedrooms, en-suite and a main bathroom.Outside is a green area to front with ample off street parking in the cobble-blocked driveway which is walled to the front. The large rear garden is south facing in aspect, two patio areas that avail of sunshine all day long, steel shed and two side passages.This fantastic detached property would make a wonderful family home for the most discerning of purchasers. \n\n\nViewing is a must."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall : - \nInset lighting, wood flooring and alarm panel. Guest w.c. off.\n\n- - \n\n\nGuest WC : - \nWith w.c., wash hand basin in vanity unit. Tiled floor and tiled splashback.\n\n- - \n\n\nLiving Room : - 5.353m x 3.625m\nFacing to front and featuring marble fireplace with stove, inset and granite hearth. Inset lighting, coving, wood flooring, t.v. point.\n\n- - \n\n\nFamily Room : - 4.694m x 2.341m\nFeaturing wood flooring, coving and inset lighting. Ideal as a 5th bedroom, playroom, an office or home gym.\n\n- - \n\n\nLiving /Dining Room : - 3.797m x 5.558m\nA bright, light-filled room with wood flooring, inset lighting & coving. French doors to southerly facing patio area. Large breakfast island with ample storage underneath.\n\n- - \n\n\nKitchen : - 2.639m x 2.510m\nModern fitted kitchen. Integrated double oven, dishwasher, microwave, hob and extractor fan. Stainless steel sink unit with swan neck tap. New York subway tiled splash back. Wood flooring and inset lighting.\n\n- - \n\n\nUtility Room : - 1.568m x 2.496m\nSide door, plumbed for dishwasher and washing machine. Upgraded boiler. Overhead press and shelving.\n\n- - \n\n\nLanding : - \nHot press with immersion and shelving. Access to the attic via ladder.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 1 : - 2.290m x 2.692m\nLarge single, shelving, built in wardrobes, wood flooring, timber panelled surround. Facing to the front.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 2 : - 3.118m x 4.554m\nLuxury double facing to the front. Built in wardrobes, inset lighting and wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nEn-suite : - \nTiled shower unit, chrome drench head shower and attachment. Window for natural light. Tiled floor. Mirror, vanity unit, wash hand basin, w.c., and inset lighting.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 3 : - 2.639m x 2.967m\nDouble bedroom facing the rear with built-in wardrobes & wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nBedroom 4 : - 2.448m x 3.703m\nDouble bedroom facing the rear with built-in wardrobes & wood flooring.\n\n- - \n\n\nBathroom: - \nWindow for natural light, tiled floor and splash back, sink and vanity unit. Extractor fan, inset lighting, bath, part tiled walls, chrome shower, rainfall shower head and shower screen.\n\n- - \n\n\nOutside : - \nLarge part walled rear garden. Stunning patio area, southerly facing, private aspect and second patio area to catch all the evening sun. Two side gates. Steel shed, outdoor tap and light socket. To the front there is a large cobble-block driveway providing ample off street parking.\n\n- - \n\n\nDisclaimer : - \nThe above are issued by DNG Doyle Naas on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars which are issued for guidance purposes only and neither the form nor the agent holds themselves responsible for any inaccuracies. The purchaser is advised to make their own arrangements to satisfy themselves with measurements, details and contents include conditions.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Superb, 4 bed detached family home</li><li> Corner Property</li><li> Newly fitted windows to the front</li><li> Upgraded Gas Boiler</li><li> Excellent condition throughout</li><li> Quality fixtures and fittings</li><li> Cobble Block Driveway</li><li> Two Side Passages</li><li> Wood Flooring</li><li> Spacious accommodation extending to c. 126.36 sq. m.</li><li> Alarm</li><li> Maintenance free exterior</li><li> Within easy walking distance of all amenities in Newbridge</li><li> Within easy commuting distance of Dublin via road or rail</ul>"
      },
